    "done_when": "imas_ambix/plot_style.py applies the data-ink sheet, carries the shared direct-label helper and names one colour role per drawn component (PF coils, OP1 vessel, OP2 vessel as lightness steps of one hue, wall, flux loops, pickup probes) plus the reference neutrals; scripts/figures_jt60sa_geometry.py holds one reader that loads load_packaged_machine_map('jt-60sa'), joins description_store_root_path() with each catalog.maps name and reads pf_active, pf_passive, wall and magnetics with imas.DBEntry into drawable families, and one cross-section function; 'uv run --no-sync python scripts/figures_jt60sa_geometry.py --palette-candidates' writes each candidate as PNG and SVG under docs/figures/jt60sa-palette/; each candidate's role colours, passed as one comma-separated hex list, are checked with 'node /home/ITER/mcintos/.cache/dataviz/validate_palette.js' using '--mode light --pairs all', and any pair below colour-blind dE 8 carries a dash or marker cue named in its caption; docs/evidence/fragments/jt60sa-geometry-and-signal-figures/jtfig-palette-candidates.html embeds every candidate with a project-absolute src, its role-to-colour table and the validator's verdict lines; 'uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ambix tests scripts/figures_jt60sa_geometry.py' exits 0",
